@startuml Sequence_AdjustStock
title Manual Stock Adjustment Flow (v0.9.2)

actor Merchant
participant "AdjustStockDialog" as UI
participant "AdjustStock" as UC
participant "AppLockService" as AppLock
participant "InventoryRepository" as InvRepo
database "SQLite" as DB

Merchant -> UI: Open adjust dialog\n(enter qty ± and reason)
Merchant -> UI: Tap "Confirm"

UI -> UC: call(productId, qtyChange, reason)
UC -> AppLock: requireSensitiveSession()
alt Store PIN on + session locked
    AppLock --> UC: throw BusinessRuleError("AppLockRequired")
    UC --> UI: error
end

UC -> InvRepo: adjustStock(productId, qtyChange, reason)

group Drift Transaction
    InvRepo -> DB: SELECT product WHERE id = productId
    alt product not found
        InvRepo --> UC: throw StateError
    end

    InvRepo -> InvRepo: newStock = currentStock + qtyChange
    alt newStock < 0
        InvRepo --> UC: throw (insufficient stock)
    end

    InvRepo -> DB: UPDATE products SET stock = stock + qtyChange,\nversion = version + 1, updated_at = now\nWHERE id = productId AND (stock + qtyChange >= 0 for stock-out)
    InvRepo -> DB: INSERT inventory_logs\n(type=ADJUSTMENT_IN or ADJUSTMENT_OUT)
end

InvRepo --> UC: success
UC --> UI: success
UI --> Merchant: Close dialog + refresh product

@enduml
